Modifications made for LockedIn (from 14 November 2026):
- Added the companion start layer and session engines: src/core/companion,
  src/server/companion, app/api/companion, companion/, docs/companion and
  tests/companion-*.
- Re-exported them from src/core/index.ts and src/server/index.ts, and added
  companion npm scripts to package.json.
- Renamed the package and the app title to LockedIn, removed the package
  homepage, and turned off provider attribution headers (src/agent/models.ts).
- Removed the upstream release, website and CI workflows (and the tests
  that pinned them), issue templates, CONTRIBUTING and SECURITY files, and
  replaced them and the README with LockedIn's own.
- Moved the engine's pages (app/layout.tsx, page.tsx, chat/, settings/,
  plugins/) into the route group app/(engine)/ so LockedIn's app at /app
  has its own root layout; URLs are unchanged.
